      "sender": "Jory Senn (Cover Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said their partner had made the original report and they would send availability. The tenant said they had tried replacing fuses and believed the TV's main board was fried; this was the tenant's view, not a technician's diagnosis. They said the TV might as well be discarded if repair was not straightforward and were open to removal. The tenant said they were using a lamp instead of the downstairs light and could manage without it for now. They also raised a separate issue: the rear-door handle had come off. Jory could not find a record of that issue and asked the tenant to submit it separately; the tenant agreed.",
      "start": 131,
      "end": 758
    },
